  "description": {
    "text": "The deck with Torchic from the Master Kit, released on 15 July 2005: two ready-built 15-card decks, 12 sideboard cards for changing them, a coin, damage counters and markers, a playmat, a how-to-play book and a CD-ROM. The CD-ROM taught the flow of a game, held a card encyclopedia of about 3,600 cards from the very first set to the Golden Sky, Silvery Ocean expansion, and had a deck builder for every card from the ADV series on."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A red/purple/brown four-square symbol at the bottom right, and a number out of 015"
  },
